<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About the Exam System - Al-Rafidain University College</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #3B82F6;
      --primary-hover: #2563EB;
      --background: #F8FAFC;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --text: #1E293B;
      --accent: #93C5FD;
      --border: #E2E8F0;
      --shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      direction: ltr;
    }
    header {
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 1rem 2rem;
      position: fixed;
      width: 100%;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 0 1rem;
    }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--primary);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .nav-links {
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .nav-links li a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .nav-links li a:hover {
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    main {
      margin-top: 80px;
    }
    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-hover));
      color: var(--surface);
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      background: url('https://via.placeholder.com/1200x800') no-repeat center center/cover;
      opacity: 0.15;
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      max-width: 800px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    /* About the System */
    .about-system {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .about-system h2 {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
    .about-system p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    /* Features */
    .features {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: var(--background);
    }
    .features h2 {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
    }
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .feature-item {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .feature-item:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .feature-item i {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .feature-item h3 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .feature-item p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    /* Call to Action */
    .cta {
      padding: 4rem 2rem;
      background: var(--background);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .cta p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }
    .cta a {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--primary);
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .cta a:hover {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: var(--surface);
    }
    /* Footer */
    footer {
      background: var(--surface);
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
      .hero p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .about-system h2 {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Header with Navigation -->
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <nav>
        <a href="#" class="logo">Exam System</a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Services</a></li>
          <li><a href="#">Contact Us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  
  <main>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Exam System</h1>
        <p>A comprehensive solution for managing and organizing exams for Al-Rafidain University College students.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    
    <!-- About the System Section -->
    <section class="about-system">
      <h2>About the System</h2>
      <p>The Exam System is an advanced electronic platform designed to facilitate effective exam management for students of Al-Rafidain University College.</p>
      <p>It provides features such as exam scheduling, result management, and performance analysis tools.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section class="features">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>System Features</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
          <div class="feature-item">
            <i class="fas fa-user-check"></i>
            <h3>User-Friendly Interface</h3>
            <p>Intuitive design allowing easy navigation for students and faculty.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-item">
            <i class="fas fa-lock"></i>
            <h3>Data Security</h3>
            <p>Advanced security measures to ensure data confidentiality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  
  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2025 Exam System - Al-Rafidain University College.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
